5. Consequences of Failure to Verify Failure to provide all requested verification details in full will constitute a violation of FCRA 611 ( a ) ( 7 ) and FCRA 1681i ( a ) ( 5 ), requiring the immediate removal of these accounts from my credit report. I will not accept automated responses, unverifiable claims, or incomplete documentation as proof of verification.

TEMPORARY SUPPRESSION OF DISPUTED ACCOUNTS 6. FCRA Mandates Temporary Suppression of Disputed Accounts Under FCRA 1681i ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ) and FCRA 1681s-2 ( a ) ( 3 ), I am demanding that all disputed accounts be suppressed from my credit file until the reinvestigation is completed.

